      <h1>{{ resort.short }} Resort: <em>The Full Guide</em></h1>
      <p class="lead">Saratoga Springs is a large Disney Vacation Club resort across the water from Disney Springs, with a boat and a walking path over. Deluxe Studios sleep four; one-bedroom villas sleep five; two-bedroom villas and Treehouse Villas sleep nine; Grand Villas sleep twelve. High Rock Spring and the Paddock Pool are the two feature pools.</p>
