    <p>In 2026, at full price with 12.5% tax included, Deluxe Studios ran about $494 to $963, one-bedroom villas about $675 to $1,341, two-bedroom villas about $986 to $2,218, Treehouse Villas about $1,226 to $2,332, and Grand Villas about $2,080 to $3,800, depending on Preferred location and the dates.</p>
