  <section id="pools">
    <h2>Pools and things to do</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>High Rock Spring Pool</strong> has waterfalls, zero-depth entry, a 128-foot slide built into the rocks, two whirlpool spas and a children's play area. On the Rocks is the pool bar here.</li>
      <li><strong>The Paddock Pool</strong> has a 146-foot slide that starts on a water tower, zero-depth entry, a horseshoe-shaped whirlpool spa and a children's aquatic play area with two small slides.</li>
      <li><strong>Three leisure pools</strong>, each with a whirlpool spa, are at the Treehouse Villas, Congress Park and The Grandstand. Official text says the latter two also have playgrounds and barbecue grills.</li>
    </ul>
