  <section id="booking">
    <h2>Booking and value tips</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Preferred location is about proximity to Disney Springs or to the Carriage House,</strong> not a different room layout. If you will walk to Springs often, it may be worth the higher rate.</li>
      <li><strong>A Treehouse is a different layout than a standard two-bedroom,</strong> with bunks and a wooded setting. Compare both if you need nine people.</li>
      <li><strong>Disney Vacation Club members book with points; cash rates are full rack prices,</strong> tax included, from the 2026 published ranges above.</li>
    </ul>
